  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There is currently no way to overwrite safety settings for icons. In safety settings you can hide everything about a user, avatar and voice etc, but when you click on an individual user you can always overwrite these settings with show/hide avatar, voice on/voice off buttons.\nSeeing as icons are a safety setting, overwriting these per user would be incredibly useful, as useful as it is for hiding and showing avatars!\nHiding (pixelating because \"reasons\") and showing icons per user would be awesome.",
